What is it?!

00:21:12.672 --> 00:21:14.006
Tomokazu?!

00:21:14.006 --> 00:21:15.641
What is this?!

00:21:15.641 --> 00:21:17.176
This feeling.

00:21:17.176 --> 00:21:18.234
I felt it.

00:21:18.611 --> 00:21:19.737
This wave is...

00:21:20.179 --> 00:21:21.441
